The first frame is the launch mark on the member theme's ground.

Before the app has drawn anything, Android paints the window, and from
Android 12 a system splash with the launcher icon on it, and then the
package's splash until the app is ready. The window and the system splash
are the ink theme's `canvas`, the system splash draws no icon, and the
package's splash draws the brand's launch mark centred on the same ground,
at the largest whole multiple of its 32 cells that fits in 96dp, so every
cell is whole pixels and the first thing drawn is the mark at the size it
stays. The colour and the drawable are the bridge's resources, drawn from
the brand's files by `scripts/brand_drawables.php`.

